  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">全新咒術迴戰任務！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Otaku Anime World – Jujutsu Kaisen Craft 邀請你在 Minecraft 中體驗獨特的動漫 RPG 冒險，在這裡力量絕非唾手可得：你必須喚醒、訓練並掌握它。<br>靈感來自《咒術迴戰》的世界，這個模組包結合了魔法、激烈戰鬥、探索與地城，為你帶來充滿動作、成長與不斷挑戰的冒險旅程。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">Otaku Anime World – Jujutsu Kaisen Craft 是一個以冒險、RPG 和戰鬥為核心的模組包，致力於在 Minecraft 中提供動漫風格體驗。其核心圍繞著 Jujutsu Kaisen Craft 模組，並透過強化探索、地城、戰利品與史詩戰鬥的模組加以擴展。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">在整個冒險過程中，你將能夠：</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🔮 掌握魔法與咒力：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">學習使用源自《咒術迴戰》的特殊技巧、獨特能力和力量。成長系統旨在讓你從一個脆弱的玩家逐步成為令人畏懼的咒術師，解鎖新的戰鬥方式與遊玩風格。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">⚔️ 體驗激烈且具挑戰性的戰鬥：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">戰鬥比原版 Minecraft 更具動態性、策略性與挑戰性。<br>面對咒靈、危險生物以及帶有獨特機制的 BOSS，你的準備工作和技能掌握將成為決定勝負的關鍵。<br></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🏰 探索地城與結構：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">世界中充滿了地城、建築和特殊區域，隱藏著強大的敵人和獨特獎勵。探索永遠有意義：更好的武器、特殊裝備和關鍵資源正在等著你。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🌍 持續的冒險與探索：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">多樣化的生態域、新建築以及一個鼓勵探索的世界，讓每一趟旅程都成為尋找挑戰和秘密的機會。並非一切盡收眼底，進步需要好奇心與冒險精神。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🎮 RPG 與多人遊戲體驗：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">本模組包專為單人與多人遊戲設計，讓你能夠：</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">- 與朋友合作遊玩</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">- 創建動漫 RPG 伺服器</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">- 體驗激烈的 PvE 戰鬥</span></div>\n<br>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>準備好和朋友一起玩了嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore%253fr%253dotaku\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">立即建立你自己的 Minecraft 伺服器，與朋友一起踏入史詩之旅！享受強勁效能、穩定運作時間及無憂體驗。別忘了使用優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VOXELCORE </a>即可獲得<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">25% 折扣</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_192b4dd7-8b2f-465c-8180-40ef3b37169d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_cb16f576-4c78-4780-857c-6dc03160aac7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_b877302a-55c2-4181-995f-f9636e396b57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></a></p>",
